# Headers on every response of the demo. Cloudflare applies this file to the Worker's static assets and does not serve
# it. The Demo site workflow checks each of them on the live site after a deploy.
#
# HTTPS only, for a year; no type sniffing; no address sent to other sites; and no other site may frame the demo. The
# demo shows documents and prints in frames of its own, so SAMEORIGIN, not DENY.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
